{"id":"m6zznrlq4z6y1xi4a232foetu","title":"端粒长度：生命衰老的分子时钟","originalTitle":null,"summary":"端粒长度与细胞分裂能力紧密相关，被视为生命衰老的分子时钟。2020年，芝加哥大学研究团队检测了1000名遗体捐赠者的25种不同组织，发现全血端粒长度能反映其他组织的端粒长度，为研究衰老和疾病提供了重要依据。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3140696&do=blog&id=1561625"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:13.937Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T05:38:13.937Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":24,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}